# One HSE evaluation of the coarse-mesh relaxation, passed to the HSE stage
# (vasp-relax-static-coarse) as its INCAR.coarse. The electronic settings are
# that runner's INCAR.coarse plus the HSE06 tags of the endpoint-pbe-hse
# campaign (ALGO Damped, LHFCALC, AEXX 0.25, HFSCREEN 0.2, TIME 0.4, ISYM 3;
# notebook log 2026-10-15-0955). PRECFOCK comes from coarse_incar_tags (Fast).
# The runner sets NSW=0, IBRION=-1, ISIF=2, LWAVE, EDIFF and ISTART/ICHARG.
# Compound settings (ENCUT, ENAUG, NBANDS) go in the job's incar_tags.
LCHARG=.FALSE.
LORBIT=11
LMAXMIX=6

ISPIN=2

ALGO=Damped
TIME=0.4
LHFCALC=.TRUE.
AEXX=0.25
HFSCREEN=0.2
PREC=Accurate
ENCUT=600
ENAUG=900
LREAL=Auto
LASPH=.TRUE.
ADDGRID=.FALSE.
ISYM=3
SYMPREC=1e-4

ISMEAR=-5

NELMIN=5
NELM=200
